# REKO3 Translation Rules

- Doc `docs/HUONG-DAN-VIET-TAT.md` truoc khi dich.
- Moi entry JSON: dien `translated` (day du) va `abbrev` (trong game).
- `abbrev` chi dung ASCII a-z A-Z 0-9 space — KHONG dau tieng Viet.
- Bat buoc: `len(abbrev) <= ascii_max`.
- Giu nguyen `id`, `offset`, `raw_hex`, `file` — chi sua translated/abbrev/status.
- `status`: "pending" | "sample" | "done"
- Ten nhan vat/dia danh dong bo voi bang viet tat co dinh.

Vi du:
- original: 短剑, ascii_max: 6 -> abbrev: "K.Ngan"
- original: 青龙偃月刀 -> abbrev: "T.Long" (Thanh Long dao)

Commit message: `dich item.json: batch 1`
